WEBVTT

01:30.770 --> 01:34.990
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.060 --> 01:37.990
[Episode 17]

01:39.350 --> 01:40.150
Come out.

01:40.680 --> 01:42.140
It's not a debt collector.

01:48.229 --> 01:51.060
Not a debt collector?

01:51.759 --> 01:53.200
Then he must be here to give me money.

01:52.100 --> 01:54.650
[Mr. Liao]

01:53.870 --> 01:54.710
As if!

01:56.350 --> 01:56.880
Let's go.

02:00.260 --> 02:01.320
I'm telling you,

02:01.430 --> 02:02.920
don't you go lending him
a large sum of money.

02:02.920 --> 02:03.480
Otherwise,

02:03.480 --> 02:05.310
he'll only be able to pay you back
in his next life.

02:05.310 --> 02:06.000
Bah.

02:07.350 --> 02:08.750
Who asked you to set a deadline for me?

02:08.750 --> 02:10.880
I won't pay it back even in my next life.

02:11.030 --> 02:11.980
We have a guest.

02:12.120 --> 02:13.040
Go make some tea quickly.

02:13.040 --> 02:13.910
Give me a break.

02:14.630 --> 02:15.310
All the tea-making utensils

02:15.310 --> 02:16.360
have been pawned by you.

02:16.360 --> 02:18.360
What am I supposed to use to make tea?

02:18.840 --> 02:19.970
Have a seat. Please.

02:22.310 --> 02:24.210
What brings you here?

02:24.840 --> 02:26.240
It's like this, Mr. Liao.

02:26.360 --> 02:28.560
My name is Gu Pingyuan,
from Shanjian Village.

02:28.560 --> 02:29.680
Mr. Bai from our village

02:29.680 --> 02:30.960
sent me here to invite you over.

02:30.960 --> 02:31.820
Invite me over?

02:33.150 --> 02:35.420
To drink and eat,

02:35.560 --> 02:37.110
or to have tea and catch up?

02:38.150 --> 02:39.450
To go process tea.

02:40.360 --> 02:41.490
P-Process tea?

02:41.910 --> 02:43.310
What tea is there to process?

02:43.310 --> 02:45.060
The tea mountains have all been

02:45.150 --> 02:46.240
burned down by those bastards.

02:46.240 --> 02:47.960
What tea is there left to process?

02:47.960 --> 02:48.770
Besides,

02:48.840 --> 02:50.840
if there were tea to process,

02:51.240 --> 02:53.230
would I have lost this badly?

02:53.590 --> 02:56.710
If there were tea to process,
you'd have lost even worse.

02:56.710 --> 02:58.430
W-We're talking business here.

02:58.430 --> 02:59.570
Stop interrupting.

03:02.960 --> 03:04.470
Don't try to fool me.

03:05.000 --> 03:05.930
I wouldn't dare.

03:06.190 --> 03:08.400
A new batch of tea seedlings
has arrived in our village.

03:08.400 --> 03:11.150
We're hoping to harvest another crop
before Qingming Festival.

03:11.150 --> 03:11.800
Everyone in the village

03:11.800 --> 03:14.000
is counting on it for their livelihood.

03:14.150 --> 03:14.960
Alright.

03:16.000 --> 03:17.000
Give it to me then.

03:17.430 --> 03:17.960
What?

03:18.280 --> 03:20.200
The money, you fool.

03:20.360 --> 03:21.750
-Oh, right.
-Are you stupid?

03:21.750 --> 03:22.380
No, no.

03:22.400 --> 03:24.240
Don't you give him money.

03:26.800 --> 03:28.060
He's got nothing left—

03:28.079 --> 03:29.280
just a mouth that talks.

03:29.280 --> 03:30.840
If you give him money, it'll be as good as
throwing it into the water.

03:30.840 --> 03:31.290
You...

03:32.800 --> 03:34.800
Of course I'd take the money

03:34.870 --> 03:35.770
to the pawnshop

03:36.030 --> 03:37.710
to redeem all the tea-processing equipment

03:37.710 --> 03:38.590
that's been pawned.

03:38.590 --> 03:39.590
That goes without saying, okay?

03:39.590 --> 03:40.520
Give it a rest.

03:41.470 --> 03:42.600
Don't give it to him.

03:46.800 --> 03:47.660
This is just...

03:52.120 --> 03:53.140
Here are the pawn vouchers.

03:52.800 --> 03:54.380
[Xing'an Pawnshop]

03:53.190 --> 03:54.120
Keep them for now

03:54.470 --> 03:55.750
and consider them as a deposit.

03:55.750 --> 03:56.430
When the time comes,

03:56.430 --> 03:58.090
redeem all those items for us.

03:58.190 --> 03:58.910
If you're sincere about

03:58.910 --> 04:00.400
inviting my father over to process tea,

04:00.400 --> 04:01.400
just send a carriage

04:01.400 --> 04:02.520
to pick us up.

04:03.270 --> 04:04.080
But you

04:04.280 --> 04:05.920
absolutely cannot give him money.

04:05.920 --> 04:06.720
I understand.

04:07.280 --> 04:08.480
Thank you, Miss Liao.

04:08.710 --> 04:09.840
Thank you, Mr. Liao.

04:11.450 --> 04:12.260
Honey.

04:12.400 --> 04:14.910
Don't undermine my reputation like this

04:15.030 --> 04:16.680
in front of Mr. Bai's friend,

04:16.720 --> 04:17.450
okay?

04:17.510 --> 04:19.540
You still have a reputation to undermine?

04:19.540 --> 04:20.160
Your reputation

04:20.160 --> 04:21.910
has been flattened by those creditors
long ago.

04:21.910 --> 04:23.350
Come on, go inside and hide.

04:23.350 --> 04:24.560
If they come to beat you up,

04:24.560 --> 04:25.600
I-I won't be able to stop them.

04:25.600 --> 04:26.460
Hurry up and go.

04:27.160 --> 04:27.720
Let's go.

04:27.750 --> 04:28.450
I'd better send you off quickly,

04:28.450 --> 04:29.120
otherwise he'll start coming up with

04:29.120 --> 04:31.430
all kinds of ways
to borrow money from you.

04:31.430 --> 04:33.690
My family can't afford that kind of debt.

04:35.310 --> 04:35.770
Please.

04:38.600 --> 04:39.070
Miss,

04:39.720 --> 04:40.830
these five taels of silver,

04:40.830 --> 04:41.850
please take them.

04:46.310 --> 04:47.370
You're pitying me.

04:48.159 --> 04:48.960
No, not at all.

04:49.200 --> 04:50.480
I just don't want your father

04:50.480 --> 04:51.880
to live in such hardship.

04:52.120 --> 04:53.409
Five taels isn't much.

04:53.630 --> 04:54.480
Please take it.

04:54.480 --> 04:55.870
You can buy some tea and food.

04:55.870 --> 04:59.090
Just consider it a token of respect
from a junior to an elder.

04:59.090 --> 05:00.830
My father's tea processing skills

05:00.830 --> 05:02.160
are second to none.

05:02.480 --> 05:04.280
I'll make sure he does a good job,

05:04.390 --> 05:05.510
and I guarantee you'll be satisfied.

05:05.510 --> 05:06.370
Thank you then.

05:11.560 --> 05:12.090
Goodbye.

05:15.190 --> 05:16.000
Honey,

05:16.340 --> 05:17.870
at least leave some cash.

05:21.800 --> 05:23.460
The debt collectors are here!

05:31.430 --> 05:32.000
Honey,

05:33.270 --> 05:35.350
just give me some loose change.

05:35.909 --> 05:37.180
I'm begging you.

05:38.560 --> 05:39.510
Honey! Honey!

05:39.800 --> 05:40.360
Honey!

05:50.650 --> 05:52.050
Why did they call us here?

05:52.180 --> 05:54.510
Don't tell me it's another tea collector.

06:00.070 --> 06:00.670
Everyone!

06:01.630 --> 06:03.090
Is everyone here?

06:03.630 --> 06:04.920
This year's tea harvest

06:04.920 --> 06:06.920
still depends on all your hard work.

06:06.920 --> 06:08.030
We need to get the tea collected.

06:08.030 --> 06:08.480
But...

06:08.220 --> 06:10.670
[Hou Er
from the Tea Merchants' Association]

06:09.190 --> 06:10.630
I-In all fairness,

06:11.250 --> 06:12.830
the tea plantation has burned down.

06:12.830 --> 06:14.760
How are we supposed to give you tea?

06:14.870 --> 06:16.710
That's right. We don't have any.

06:16.920 --> 06:17.630
Besides,

06:17.780 --> 06:19.440
when are you going to pay back

06:19.600 --> 06:20.850
the tea money you already owed us?

06:20.850 --> 06:22.270
Pay up! Pay up! Pay up!

06:22.310 --> 06:23.000
Gu Pingwen.

06:23.750 --> 06:25.270
Your family's tea is

06:25.310 --> 06:26.680
of the worst quality, honestly.

06:26.680 --> 06:28.310
If I hadn't been so generous

06:28.360 --> 06:29.290
to buy your tea,

06:29.950 --> 06:31.210
who else would want it?

06:31.750 --> 06:33.480
And you dare to ask me for money?

06:34.120 --> 06:34.650
Get lost!

06:36.850 --> 06:38.510
We're here today to give you a reminder:

06:38.510 --> 06:40.000
with war raging everywhere,

06:40.000 --> 06:41.390
if it weren't for Mr. Hou Er

06:41.390 --> 06:42.880
finding you buyers,

06:43.270 --> 06:44.800
you'd all be left starving!

06:46.909 --> 06:48.430
Each and every one of you,

06:48.480 --> 06:50.010
don't say I didn't warn you.

06:50.870 --> 06:51.720
If you dare to damage

06:51.720 --> 06:53.380
my reputation,

06:54.310 --> 06:56.070
don't even think about
getting your tea money—

06:56.070 --> 06:57.110
not even a penny!

06:57.920 --> 06:58.450
Let's go.

06:59.040 --> 06:59.570
Let's go.

07:00.560 --> 07:01.220
Move aside!

07:13.630 --> 07:18.140
♪ Tea picking in January
marks the new year ♪

07:18.430 --> 07:22.800
♪ Tea picking in February
welcomes the new spring ♪

07:23.390 --> 07:27.870
♪ Tea picking in March,
as peach blossoms blush crimson ♪

07:28.240 --> 07:32.600
♪ Tea picking in April keeps us busy ♪

07:33.070 --> 07:37.700
♪ Tea picking in September,
when chrysanthemums are yellow ♪

07:38.000 --> 07:42.270
♪ Tea picking in October,
when it's briefly warm ♪

07:42.870 --> 07:47.190
♪ Tea picking in November,
when snowflakes fall ♪

07:47.720 --> 07:57.000
♪ Tea picking in December,
when another year passes ♪

08:54.360 --> 08:55.130
Mr. Liao.

09:00.870 --> 09:02.070
How did I fall asleep?

09:06.030 --> 09:06.830
It's gone bad.

09:08.960 --> 09:10.290
I watched Pingwen

09:10.320 --> 09:11.510
put the rice ball in his mouth

09:11.510 --> 09:13.120
and fall asleep without even chewing.

09:13.120 --> 09:14.480
Pingyuan, look how hard I've worked.

09:14.480 --> 09:16.610
I could fall asleep even while eating.

09:25.790 --> 09:26.790
You can't do that.

09:27.820 --> 09:28.860
Why can't I?

09:29.030 --> 09:30.230
Get the bamboo sieve.

09:38.370 --> 09:39.900
Bring the fresh tea leaves!

09:51.440 --> 09:52.030
Mr. Liao.

09:52.630 --> 09:54.200
This tea has a strange aroma.

09:54.200 --> 09:54.730
Strange?

09:54.910 --> 09:55.910
How is it strange?

09:57.260 --> 09:58.590
It seems to have a hint of

09:59.200 --> 10:00.530
pine needle fragrance,

10:00.960 --> 10:02.200
like the scent of morning sunlight

10:02.200 --> 10:04.060
streaming through a pine forest.

10:05.840 --> 10:06.320
Father.

10:06.630 --> 10:07.490
You heard that?

10:07.720 --> 10:08.610
You know what this is called?

10:08.610 --> 10:10.450
This is called
"goods find their discerning buyer."

10:10.450 --> 10:11.600
So stop boasting about

10:11.600 --> 10:13.000
no one understanding you.

10:13.000 --> 10:14.750
There is a pine needle fragrance.

10:14.750 --> 10:16.210
You're absolutely right.

10:17.830 --> 10:19.440
This cast iron wok of mine,

10:19.720 --> 10:21.390
do you know how old it is?

10:21.590 --> 10:22.300
No idea.

10:23.240 --> 10:25.900
Made during the Jiajing era
of the Ming Dynasty.

10:27.240 --> 10:28.140
It's this old?

10:28.870 --> 10:31.200
This has been passed down
from the elders.

10:31.720 --> 10:34.380
The older a wok is, the better it works,
you know?

10:34.600 --> 10:36.800
It's just it rusts easily.

10:37.120 --> 10:38.650
And it gets hot to the touch.

10:39.030 --> 10:40.940
You need to use it often

10:41.180 --> 10:42.510
and maintain it regularly.

10:42.510 --> 10:43.660
Do you know how

10:44.120 --> 10:46.050
our elders maintained these woks?

10:47.000 --> 10:48.060
With pine needles?

10:49.030 --> 10:49.830
That's right.

10:50.840 --> 10:52.600
Stir-frying pine needles
serves two purposes:

10:52.600 --> 10:55.400
first, to let the young ones
practice their craft;

10:55.630 --> 10:57.970
second, to extract the oil
from the pine needles

10:57.970 --> 10:59.100
to season the wok.

10:59.440 --> 11:01.900
This wok has been used for
hundreds of years,

11:02.080 --> 11:04.320
so naturally the tea takes on

11:04.480 --> 11:06.180
that subtle pinewood aroma.

11:06.600 --> 11:08.950
You can savor it subtly,
yet can't quite catch it.

11:08.950 --> 11:10.270
That's the beauty of it—

11:10.270 --> 11:11.670
in its subtlety.

11:12.080 --> 11:15.140
Combined with the way
I control the heat when frying the tea,

11:15.140 --> 11:16.520
it makes the tea

11:16.870 --> 11:18.310
taste fresh on the palate

11:19.200 --> 11:21.460
with a lingering, delicate aftertaste.

11:22.770 --> 11:23.850
Alright, Father.

11:24.000 --> 11:25.460
Stop weighing yourself up

11:25.510 --> 11:27.170
and singing your own praises.

11:28.920 --> 11:29.720
How is

11:29.750 --> 11:30.850
Mr. Bai's health?

11:31.510 --> 11:32.240
He's gotten better.

11:32.240 --> 11:32.970
That's good.

11:33.120 --> 11:34.080
After I finish processing this tea,

11:34.080 --> 11:35.210
I'll go check on him.

11:38.270 --> 11:40.130
Bring some more fresh tea leaves.

11:40.200 --> 11:41.690
I-I'll help.

11:41.790 --> 11:42.440
Hurry up.

11:45.850 --> 11:46.910
Listen, Pingyuan.

11:47.910 --> 11:50.480
I'm just like Mr. Bai,

11:50.500 --> 11:51.830
with only one daughter.

11:52.080 --> 11:54.340
If anyone tries to take my daughter away,

11:54.650 --> 11:55.600
I'll kill him.

11:57.790 --> 11:59.230
I think Pingwen

11:59.250 --> 12:00.280
is a good man.

12:00.790 --> 12:02.090
To save his life,

12:02.480 --> 12:05.140
how about letting him be
my live-in son-in-law?

12:09.220 --> 12:10.400
What's going on with you guys?

12:10.400 --> 12:11.100
Chop-chop.

12:58.470 --> 13:02.470
[Gu's Mansion]

13:05.510 --> 13:06.040
Mother.

13:09.580 --> 13:10.780
It smells wonderful.

13:11.510 --> 13:12.370
Give it a taste.

13:14.240 --> 13:15.320
What's the rush?

13:16.110 --> 13:17.840
I haven't finished enjoying the aroma yet.

13:17.840 --> 13:18.840
Drinking it now

13:19.080 --> 13:20.010
would be a waste.

13:20.790 --> 13:21.790
Mrs. Gu,

13:22.150 --> 13:23.150
you're an expert.

13:24.640 --> 13:26.170
I've grown tea my whole life

13:26.240 --> 13:27.840
and have only managed to
understand a little.

13:27.840 --> 13:30.570
I wouldn't dare show off
in front of you, Mr. Liao.

13:48.720 --> 13:49.980
It's truly excellent.

13:51.910 --> 13:52.860
So tell me,

13:53.550 --> 13:54.880
what makes it so good?

13:55.750 --> 13:57.060
As this tea goes down

13:58.240 --> 14:00.330
from my lips to tongue,

14:00.480 --> 14:01.540
and then to throat,

14:02.150 --> 14:04.010
the aroma changes at every point.

14:04.240 --> 14:06.370
The fragrance is also quite peculiar.

14:06.550 --> 14:08.750
There's the fresh scent of pine needles

14:09.240 --> 14:11.240
and also a hint of orchid fragrance.

14:11.440 --> 14:12.390
But I'm clearly drinking

14:12.390 --> 14:13.870
our family's Silver Bud tea.

14:13.870 --> 14:15.110
What's going on here?

14:16.120 --> 14:17.680
Why don't you take a guess?

14:20.270 --> 14:21.260
Well, I think

14:21.440 --> 14:23.570
since they burned the tea plantation,

14:23.870 --> 14:25.670
the soil got strong fire energy.

14:26.830 --> 14:28.560
And before harvesting the tea,

14:28.670 --> 14:30.170
there were two rainfalls.

14:30.720 --> 14:32.650
The rain before Qingming Festival

14:33.000 --> 14:34.400
is heavy with yin energy.

14:35.150 --> 14:37.150
The bright fire meets the yin water.

14:38.270 --> 14:39.210
Tea growers

14:39.270 --> 14:41.670
call this fragrance
"the aroma of providence."

14:41.670 --> 14:43.510
I don't know if I'm right.

14:43.750 --> 14:45.460
That's exactly it.

14:46.000 --> 14:46.960
Mrs. Gu.

14:47.010 --> 14:48.630
I'm truly impressed by you.

14:48.680 --> 14:50.750
You're a real expert.

14:50.920 --> 14:52.000
So here's what I'll do.

14:52.000 --> 14:52.920
From now on,

14:53.030 --> 14:54.950
I'll process tea for your family

14:55.010 --> 14:56.520
without charging a single penny.

14:56.520 --> 14:57.670
This won't do.

14:58.710 --> 14:59.480
Mr. Liao.

14:59.720 --> 15:01.090
Since we've obtained this fine tea,

15:01.090 --> 15:02.620
why don't you give it a name?

15:02.790 --> 15:05.390
Then I'll respectfully oblige.

15:06.430 --> 15:08.860
I've been processing tea my entire life,

15:10.270 --> 15:12.630
and this is the masterpiece of my life.

15:13.480 --> 15:14.270
There's an ancient book

15:14.270 --> 15:16.000
on tea processing in my house.

15:16.440 --> 15:17.420
The book says,

15:17.870 --> 15:20.140
"its fragrance resembles orchids,

15:20.360 --> 15:22.220
and its buds whiter than snow,

15:22.270 --> 15:23.940
thus named Orchid Snow."

15:24.320 --> 15:25.250
What do you think

15:25.270 --> 15:26.240
of the name Orchid Snow?

15:26.240 --> 15:26.870
It sounds beautiful.

15:26.870 --> 15:27.440
Great.

15:27.670 --> 15:28.400
Orchid Snow.

15:28.440 --> 15:29.240
That's it then.

15:29.240 --> 15:29.900
Alright.

15:29.960 --> 15:31.550
I'll go check on Mr. Bai.

15:31.840 --> 15:32.750
I'll go with you.

15:32.750 --> 15:33.320
Let's go.

15:36.390 --> 15:37.220
Mr. Liao.

15:37.550 --> 15:38.720
I've asked Pingwen

15:38.750 --> 15:40.510
to inform everyone in the village.

15:40.510 --> 15:41.890
I'm thinking about selling all the tea

15:41.890 --> 15:43.290
of our village this year.

15:44.080 --> 15:44.910
Are you crazy?

15:45.320 --> 15:46.220
As you said,

15:46.480 --> 15:47.840
this tea has a unique aroma,

15:47.840 --> 15:49.030
which is truly extraordinary.

15:49.030 --> 15:50.790
I think it's a great business opportunity.

15:50.790 --> 15:52.450
So you know how to do business?

15:52.490 --> 15:53.750
I didn't realize that.

15:54.200 --> 15:56.580
Do you know who

15:56.960 --> 15:57.840
all this tea is for?

15:57.840 --> 15:58.610
I do.

15:59.150 --> 16:01.080
Isn't it that Master Hou?Mr. Hou Er

16:01.270 --> 16:02.080
He always buys

16:02.120 --> 16:02.760
our tea at

16:02.790 --> 16:03.630
the lowest price,

16:02.980 --> 16:11.730
[Gu's Mansion]

16:04.030 --> 16:04.750
and he often

16:04.790 --> 16:06.200
delays paying the tea farmers.

16:06.200 --> 16:08.060
So I want to take this opportunity

16:08.510 --> 16:09.510
to sell it myself,

16:09.510 --> 16:10.510
so as to give back to the villagers

16:10.510 --> 16:12.370
and let them make some profit too.

16:13.670 --> 16:15.080
You... Sell it yourself?

16:16.220 --> 16:17.680
Let me tell you something.

16:18.140 --> 16:19.160
Tea

16:19.510 --> 16:21.220
is just like a young lady—

16:22.200 --> 16:23.320
once this period passes,

16:23.320 --> 16:24.580
it won't be worth much.

16:25.670 --> 16:26.530
Thinking about

16:26.870 --> 16:28.080
doing business.

16:28.240 --> 16:29.390
I mean, you...

16:30.150 --> 16:31.600
I beat those 10 people so badly

16:31.600 --> 16:32.670
that they even called me "father."

16:32.670 --> 16:33.270
"Father."

16:34.240 --> 16:35.300
What are you doing?

16:37.630 --> 16:38.510
Why don't you

16:38.600 --> 16:40.460
consider my suggestion?

16:45.150 --> 16:45.960
Pingwen!

16:46.790 --> 16:48.120
I asked you to collect tea buds.

16:48.120 --> 16:49.550
How many have you collected?

16:49.550 --> 16:50.410
5,000 catties.

16:51.200 --> 16:52.360
5,000 catties?

16:53.390 --> 16:55.680
You bought the whole village's tea?

16:55.710 --> 16:56.970
You think I was joking?

16:56.990 --> 16:58.050
I really bought it.

16:58.150 --> 16:59.390
That's quite a move.

17:00.030 --> 17:02.030
You're young, yet quite ambitious.

17:02.750 --> 17:03.820
This time,

17:03.910 --> 17:05.829
you'll have to fight it out with them.

17:05.829 --> 17:06.960
Want to make a bet

17:06.980 --> 17:07.910
and see who wins?

17:09.490 --> 17:10.069
No.

17:10.920 --> 17:11.440
Father.

17:11.589 --> 17:12.480
I've been thinking.

17:12.480 --> 17:13.550
Those tea-processing utensils of ours,

17:13.550 --> 17:14.940
let's not take them back.

17:14.940 --> 17:16.400
So you won't pawn them again.

17:16.400 --> 17:18.550
Otherwise, you'll even have nothing
to brag about.

17:18.550 --> 17:19.770
Not taking them back?

17:20.109 --> 17:21.790
Then who's going to maintain the wok?

17:21.790 --> 17:22.790
You had it pawned for half a year.

17:22.790 --> 17:24.160
I didn't see you maintaining it either—

17:24.160 --> 17:26.069
just left it in the pawnshop to rust.

17:26.069 --> 17:28.099
Don't always say things

17:28.160 --> 17:30.290
I don't like to hear in front of others.

17:32.070 --> 17:34.330
What do we do
if we don't take the wok back?

17:35.640 --> 17:36.590
Leave it at his house.

17:36.590 --> 17:39.190
We'll come back to process tea again
next year.

17:42.200 --> 17:42.880
Gu Pingwen.

17:43.350 --> 17:44.870
Let's talk.

17:46.380 --> 17:47.770
I can see right through

17:47.830 --> 17:49.800
your little schemes!

17:49.830 --> 17:50.490
Ouch, ouch.

17:50.510 --> 17:51.710
Control your father!

17:51.880 --> 17:52.400
Stop it.

17:52.720 --> 17:53.300
Alright.

17:55.240 --> 17:56.900
We still need to visit Mr. Bai.

17:58.210 --> 17:59.210
I'm watching you.

18:07.200 --> 18:08.270
The boiling water

18:08.400 --> 18:09.660
has different stages.

18:10.160 --> 18:12.200
Right now, it's at the "crab-eye boil,"

18:12.200 --> 18:14.200
when it looks like the eyes of a crab.

18:14.440 --> 18:16.420
At this point,

18:16.590 --> 18:18.440
the water is 70% cooked

18:18.580 --> 18:19.480
and 30% raw—

18:19.550 --> 18:21.800
perfect for

18:22.420 --> 18:23.240
brewing aged tea.

18:23.240 --> 18:23.700
Look,

18:24.160 --> 18:24.930
now

18:25.110 --> 18:26.770
it's at "lotus-flower boil."

18:26.960 --> 18:28.100
From bottom to top,

18:28.200 --> 18:29.590
it forms a column of water,

18:29.590 --> 18:32.450
and the water bubbles grow larger
as they rise.

18:32.960 --> 18:34.110
The temperature now

18:34.530 --> 18:36.250
is 90% cooked

18:36.880 --> 18:37.680
and 10% raw.

18:38.720 --> 18:39.980
For brewing fresh tea,

18:40.030 --> 18:43.020
this is the perfect timing.

18:44.920 --> 18:46.250
This water temperature

18:46.550 --> 18:48.940
can also remove the grassy smell

18:49.110 --> 18:50.240
from the tea leaves.

18:50.790 --> 18:51.310
Look.

18:52.060 --> 18:53.790
This is what we call "lotus-leaf boil."

18:53.790 --> 18:55.520
It's 100% cooked.

18:59.920 --> 19:01.420
When a person gets old,

19:01.910 --> 19:03.210
everything clears up—

19:03.270 --> 19:04.730
except the blood vessels.

19:05.790 --> 19:07.270
They lose interest

19:07.590 --> 19:08.740
in worldly matters.

19:09.070 --> 19:11.070
Living on in good health is alright,

19:11.080 --> 19:13.350
but if they're alive
and constantly sick and frail,

19:13.350 --> 19:14.880
then there's no point in it.

19:15.750 --> 19:18.400
Might as well die early
and reincarnate sooner.

19:18.400 --> 19:18.940
Father.

19:19.110 --> 19:20.910
You're talking nonsense again.

19:23.920 --> 19:26.410
This snow you preserved last year

19:26.550 --> 19:27.750
is really excellent.

19:29.760 --> 19:31.380
If you like it, drink more.

19:33.920 --> 19:35.380
It was Yimei's doing.

19:35.440 --> 19:36.240
I could never manage that kind of

19:36.240 --> 19:37.820
slow, meticulous work.

19:41.510 --> 19:43.640
This snow was collected so well.

19:46.880 --> 19:49.340
I really can't bear to use it.

19:49.480 --> 19:50.410
If it's all gone,

19:50.480 --> 19:51.610
what will you drink?

19:52.920 --> 19:55.050
I won't be drinking it for much longer.

19:55.270 --> 19:56.000
That's true.

19:56.240 --> 19:57.810
Just drink it all.

19:59.270 --> 20:00.810
That kid is quite skillful.

20:02.440 --> 20:04.240
Every winter she would store

20:04.270 --> 20:05.870
dozens of jars of snow in the cellar

20:05.870 --> 20:07.470
for me to use for brewing tea.

20:09.110 --> 20:11.400
Those days are gone now.

20:13.070 --> 20:14.110
People can't possibly drink good tea

20:14.110 --> 20:16.700
for a whole lifetime.

20:17.510 --> 20:19.550
When we have good tea, we drink it—

20:19.640 --> 20:21.200
there's no need to hold back.

20:21.200 --> 20:22.750
And when it's gone, don't dwell on it.

20:22.750 --> 20:23.750
If you dwell on it,

20:24.000 --> 20:26.060
you're just making yourself suffer.

20:27.550 --> 20:28.790
That's true.

20:29.880 --> 20:31.200
I've enjoyed more than 10 years

20:31.200 --> 20:32.510
of my daughter's care.

20:34.480 --> 20:36.880
How can I still be clinging to
these things?

20:40.350 --> 20:42.410
You see things more clearly than I do.

21:00.030 --> 21:00.830
What's wrong?

21:02.720 --> 21:03.630
Nothing.

21:04.440 --> 21:05.110
Nothing?

21:06.440 --> 21:07.900
You know, a gambler's eyes

21:08.000 --> 21:09.400
are as sharp as scissors.

21:09.680 --> 21:11.080
Saying nothing's wrong?

21:13.590 --> 21:14.460
Mr. Bai...

21:14.940 --> 21:16.340
He's suffering greatly.

21:19.440 --> 21:22.200
Who in this world doesn't suffer?

21:23.350 --> 21:24.920
Even the Emperor himself—

21:25.350 --> 21:26.680
he used to be that happy,

21:26.880 --> 21:28.560
yet he died in Rehe,

21:28.590 --> 21:30.520
becoming a ghost in a foreign land.

21:30.550 --> 21:32.200
Enough. Stop talking nonsense.

21:32.200 --> 21:32.920
Hurry up and plug

21:32.920 --> 21:34.380
that hole under your nose.

21:35.960 --> 21:37.560
Mr. Liao isn't wrong though.

21:39.070 --> 21:40.370
Mr. Bai's pulse

21:40.590 --> 21:42.320
has actually already stopped.

21:42.480 --> 21:44.680
Sometimes I can feel it, sometimes not.

21:44.720 --> 21:46.650
He's hanging on by a single breath.

21:47.240 --> 21:47.920
I know

21:48.440 --> 21:50.240
there's resentment in his heart

21:50.350 --> 21:52.350
and can't let go of certain matters.

21:53.680 --> 21:54.930
He always talks

21:55.000 --> 21:56.680
as if he sees through everything,

21:56.680 --> 21:58.010
but that may not be true.

21:58.590 --> 21:59.480
People all have

21:59.720 --> 22:01.050
their own attachments.

22:05.240 --> 22:06.100
Think about it—

22:06.790 --> 22:09.270
if anyone dares to
run off with my daughter,

22:11.000 --> 22:13.390
I'll slaughter him with my own hands.

22:15.160 --> 22:16.630
Listen to yourself.

22:36.720 --> 22:37.650
These past days,

22:38.420 --> 22:39.160
Mr. Bai can still occasionally

22:39.160 --> 22:40.440
crack a joke or two,

22:42.110 --> 22:42.960
but I know

22:43.960 --> 22:45.490
he's just forcing himself.

22:47.920 --> 22:50.780
My friend Bai spent his whole life
doing good deeds.

22:52.070 --> 22:54.270
He doesn't deserve to suffer like this.

23:07.350 --> 23:07.970
Mr. Liao,

23:08.240 --> 23:09.300
what are you doing?

23:10.480 --> 23:11.540
I'll go see him off.

23:13.070 --> 23:14.470
What are you trying to do?

23:35.550 --> 23:36.240
Bai.

23:39.110 --> 23:40.640
This cup is already old.

23:42.350 --> 23:43.680
It's okay to replace it.

23:47.700 --> 23:50.740
Each generation has its own blessings.

23:51.720 --> 23:53.380
Holding onto it is pointless.

24:07.070 --> 24:08.310
Thanks a lot.

24:25.480 --> 24:26.110
Bai.

24:31.960 --> 24:33.620
Have a peaceful journey.

24:49.480 --> 24:50.340
Let's go drink.

24:59.240 --> 24:59.830
Sir...

25:04.770 --> 25:10.440
[A long journey
with heavy responsibilities]

25:23.040 --> 25:26.040
[Guiding to the Western Paradise]

25:26.510 --> 25:30.330
[Mr. Bai Shi'an's Tomb]

25:28.830 --> 25:29.510
Sir.

25:30.270 --> 25:32.200
You've treated me like your own son

25:32.790 --> 25:34.850
and taught me the principles of life.

25:35.480 --> 25:36.720
Although Yimei and I

25:37.750 --> 25:39.950
aren't destined to be husband and wife,

25:40.110 --> 25:42.240
we still share a brother-sister bond.

25:43.880 --> 25:45.610
If I meet her again in this life,

25:46.640 --> 25:47.590
I will definitely do my best

25:47.590 --> 25:48.580
to protect her.

25:50.160 --> 25:51.360
Please rest assured.

26:02.240 --> 26:05.820
[Mr. Bai Shi'an's Tomb]

26:05.940 --> 26:09.610
[Guiding to the Western Paradise]

26:21.710 --> 26:28.060
[Guiding to the Western Paradise]

26:29.880 --> 26:30.590
Mr. Liao.

26:31.550 --> 26:33.880
There's something I want to ask you about.

26:34.510 --> 26:36.430
You're a scholar,

26:36.880 --> 26:38.440
and I'm merely a worthless gambler,

26:38.440 --> 26:39.240
an old codger.

26:39.240 --> 26:40.840
What's there to ask me about?

26:42.640 --> 26:44.880
I don't understand why
the moment you smashed the cup,

26:44.880 --> 26:46.540
Mr. Bai departed peacefully.

26:49.160 --> 26:50.220
You see, people

26:50.890 --> 26:52.150
grow from young to old,

26:53.480 --> 26:54.640
aging gradually.

26:55.930 --> 26:57.460
Getting old is only normal.

26:57.960 --> 26:59.720
After death, we simply

27:00.240 --> 27:02.410
take on a new physical form.

27:03.410 --> 27:05.750
Obsessing over an old cup

27:05.880 --> 27:07.010
and cold tea leaves—

27:07.030 --> 27:09.430
foolish even more than this old codger
I am.

27:18.510 --> 27:21.370
I, Gu Pingyuan,
humbly take your teaching to heart.

27:32.550 --> 27:33.350
Bai.

27:34.380 --> 27:35.710
I was planning to

27:36.110 --> 27:37.710
have one last drink with you.

27:41.780 --> 27:43.460
You left too soon.

27:49.060 --> 27:51.330
[Mr. Bai Shi'an's Tomb]

27:51.020 --> 27:51.950
Let's meet again

27:54.070 --> 27:55.240
in the underworld.

27:58.070 --> 27:59.130
This gourd of wine,

27:59.510 --> 28:02.040
[Guiding to the Western Paradise]

28:00.270 --> 28:01.730
I'll leave it here for you.

28:06.590 --> 28:07.400
Bai,

28:09.960 --> 28:11.220
there isn't much wine.

28:13.110 --> 28:14.580
Drink it sparingly.

28:31.370 --> 28:35.450
[Guiding to the Western Paradise]

28:45.950 --> 28:50.360
[Spring Breeze of Yi River]

28:46.030 --> 28:46.720
Mr. Gu!

28:48.110 --> 28:48.680
Mr. Gu!

28:49.960 --> 28:50.680
Open up!

28:54.160 --> 28:54.750
Mr. Gu!

28:55.310 --> 28:56.120
Mr. Gu!

28:55.850 --> 29:01.180
[Gu's Mansion]

28:57.030 --> 28:57.830
Open up!

28:59.640 --> 29:00.590
Mr. Gu! Mr. Gu!

29:01.350 --> 29:02.880
Gu, Gu, Gu! Keep calling Gu!

29:02.960 --> 29:04.760
Are you laying eggs here or what?

29:04.960 --> 29:05.960
Catch your breath first

29:05.960 --> 29:06.960
and speak slowly.

29:07.550 --> 29:08.880
Who is it? Look at you—

29:09.070 --> 29:10.470
your face is all twisted.

29:10.590 --> 29:11.810
Mr. Hou Er is here.

29:12.550 --> 29:13.070
Who?

29:13.440 --> 29:14.250
Mr. Hou Er.

29:15.240 --> 29:15.900
I got it.

29:16.070 --> 29:17.400
Is he the Almighty or something?

29:17.400 --> 29:19.000
Do you need to be this scared?

29:19.480 --> 29:21.030
But he's the biggest tea merchant

29:21.030 --> 29:21.910
in Huizhou.

29:22.720 --> 29:23.880
He's always been the one

29:23.880 --> 29:25.000
who buys our village's tea.

29:25.000 --> 29:27.060
This year, he heard you bought it all,

29:27.550 --> 29:29.340
and he's a bit... A bit upset.

29:30.440 --> 29:32.310
He's resting at the ancestral hall now.

29:32.310 --> 29:33.710
He sent me to ask you over.

29:34.480 --> 29:35.350
He sent for me?

29:36.350 --> 29:37.480
Tell him I'm not available.

29:37.480 --> 29:38.960
I'm not even fully awake yet.

29:38.960 --> 29:39.860
[Gu's Mansion]

29:41.310 --> 29:41.830
Mr. Gu.

29:41.920 --> 29:43.180
Don't be like this.

29:43.510 --> 29:44.790
You really don't know

29:44.880 --> 29:46.200
what Mr. Hou Er is capable of.

29:46.200 --> 29:47.720
It would scare you to death if I told you.

29:47.720 --> 29:48.980
Then tell me. Scare me.

29:49.790 --> 29:52.310
He's a member of
the Tea Merchants' Association.

29:52.310 --> 29:54.570
What's the Tea Merchants' Association?

29:55.070 --> 29:56.150
In Anhui Province,

29:56.350 --> 29:57.920
there's a Tea Merchants' Association.

29:57.920 --> 30:00.270
The members are all
centuries-old major tea guilds.

30:00.270 --> 30:01.700
All the tea trading

30:01.790 --> 30:03.650
and transport is handled by them.

30:04.160 --> 30:05.220
As for this matter,

30:05.270 --> 30:06.720
it was just people from our village

30:06.720 --> 30:07.910
trying to take advantage of you.

30:07.880 --> 30:11.040
[Gu's Mansion]

30:08.030 --> 30:09.240
They saw your high offer

30:09.240 --> 30:10.240
and sold it to you.

30:10.270 --> 30:11.250
But you should know

30:11.250 --> 30:12.790
this is the kind of thing
that can bring trouble.

30:12.790 --> 30:13.650
Bring trouble?

30:13.830 --> 30:15.990
Haven't I brought enough trouble already?

30:15.990 --> 30:17.140
Go tell that...

30:17.750 --> 30:18.650
Hou Er, right?

30:20.310 --> 30:21.160
Mr. Hou Er.

30:21.180 --> 30:22.510
Go tell Mr. Hou Er

30:22.750 --> 30:24.000
that Mr. Gu will see him

30:24.000 --> 30:24.920
after he's finished his breakfast

30:24.920 --> 30:25.780
and had his tea,

30:25.940 --> 30:26.800
and not before.

30:27.110 --> 30:27.960
If he doesn't like it,

30:27.960 --> 30:29.150
he can go back where he came from.

30:29.150 --> 30:32.590
[Gu's Mansion]

30:29.920 --> 30:31.160
You can't be like this.

30:31.160 --> 30:32.430
You're too young.

30:32.550 --> 30:33.930
You really don't know

30:34.000 --> 30:35.440
what Mr. Hou Er is capable of.

30:35.440 --> 30:36.640
I've heard about him.

30:37.070 --> 30:38.000
Every time he comes,

30:38.000 --> 30:39.030
he acts like an emperor—

30:39.030 --> 30:39.960
yelling and scolding,

30:39.960 --> 30:40.960
being picky about everything,

30:40.960 --> 30:41.680
owing tea farmers money

30:41.680 --> 30:42.510
and not paying for half a year at a time—

30:42.510 --> 30:43.710
that's him, isn't it?

30:43.920 --> 30:44.830
Tell him

30:45.070 --> 30:46.550
I've decided to buy this batch of tea.

30:46.550 --> 30:47.270
I won't let him

30:47.270 --> 30:48.030
have his way.

30:48.270 --> 30:49.480
If he's unhappy about it,

30:49.480 --> 30:50.940
let him come to me himself.

30:51.870 --> 30:54.710
[Gu's Mansion]

31:07.400 --> 31:08.400
Mr. Hou Er,

31:08.750 --> 31:10.080
guess what?

31:10.510 --> 31:12.290
Gu Pingyuan is not awake yet.

31:12.590 --> 31:13.930
You came too early.

31:15.270 --> 31:16.630
How about I get you some

31:16.750 --> 31:17.410
food first?

31:18.080 --> 31:19.640
Do you know how many villages

31:19.640 --> 31:20.500
I visit in a day?

31:20.880 --> 31:22.830
You want me to wait here
until he wakes up?

31:22.830 --> 31:23.240
Go,

31:23.480 --> 31:24.640
bang something to wake him up.

31:24.640 --> 31:26.700
Please don't be like this, Mr. Hou Er.

31:27.030 --> 31:28.110
These tea pickers

31:28.160 --> 31:29.720
go all day without food or water,

31:29.720 --> 31:31.350
and they can barely walk straight.

31:31.350 --> 31:32.430
If you have me bang on his door,

31:32.430 --> 31:33.950
he'll beat me up.

31:46.960 --> 31:47.620
Gentlemen,

31:47.880 --> 31:48.410
welcome.

31:48.680 --> 31:50.200
What would you like to drink?

31:50.200 --> 31:51.750
What good stuff do you have here?

31:51.750 --> 31:53.240
What kind would you prefer?

31:53.240 --> 31:53.770
This way.

31:53.790 --> 31:54.390
Local tea.

31:54.480 --> 31:55.280
For local tea,

31:55.350 --> 31:56.640
I recommend Silver Bud.

31:56.640 --> 31:57.510
It's not expensive

31:57.510 --> 31:58.970
and has a wonderful aroma.

31:59.270 --> 32:00.800
Bring us a bit of every kind.

32:03.280 --> 32:04.620
Try this Silver Bud.

32:05.240 --> 32:05.750
Please.

32:12.030 --> 32:12.830
What's wrong?

32:13.240 --> 32:14.040
Is it not good?

32:15.200 --> 32:15.890
Boss.

32:16.830 --> 32:18.600
Do we look like we can't afford to pay?

32:18.600 --> 32:19.480
Why didn't you bring us

32:19.480 --> 32:20.680
your best Silver Bud?

32:21.590 --> 32:23.270
I would never underestimate you gentlemen.

32:23.270 --> 32:24.130
This Silver Bud

32:24.240 --> 32:25.570
is already top quality.

32:25.750 --> 32:26.810
This stuff of yours

32:26.880 --> 32:28.940
is all coarse stems and large leaves.

32:29.240 --> 32:31.270
There's not a trace of
premium golden buds.

32:31.270 --> 32:32.200
Is this what you call

32:32.200 --> 32:33.110
top quality?

32:35.960 --> 32:36.780
Gentlemen,

32:37.200 --> 32:37.920
my bad.

32:38.400 --> 32:39.930
You're true connoisseurs.

32:40.240 --> 32:41.030
There's something

32:41.030 --> 32:41.920
you don't know.

32:42.160 --> 32:44.310
This year, His Majesty is holding
a Grand Tea Competition.

32:44.310 --> 32:45.550
The Tea Merchants' Association

32:45.550 --> 32:46.960
has collected all the finest tea leaves

32:46.960 --> 32:47.960
from everywhere,

32:48.270 --> 32:49.680
saying they're transporting them
to Beijing

32:49.680 --> 32:50.880
for the competition.

32:51.170 --> 32:52.990
What is the Grand Tea Competition?

32:52.990 --> 32:55.060
[Tea Merchants' Association]

32:55.160 --> 32:56.260
Old Master Hu.

32:57.440 --> 32:58.440
This Grand Tea Competition,

32:58.440 --> 32:59.640
what exactly is it about?

32:59.640 --> 33:01.070
Everyone's talking about it.

33:01.070 --> 33:02.650
We're all here to ask

33:02.900 --> 33:03.880
what our Tea Merchants' Association

33:03.880 --> 33:04.540
has in plan,

33:04.920 --> 33:05.880
so we can prepare accordingly.

33:05.880 --> 33:06.750
Yes, indeed.

33:06.920 --> 33:07.430
Well...

33:08.030 --> 33:09.480
That's just a gimmick.

33:10.160 --> 33:12.270
The new Emperor has just taken the throne,

33:12.270 --> 33:13.920
those provinces south of Yangtze River

33:13.920 --> 33:15.380
have just been liberated,

33:15.710 --> 33:16.860
and the Grand Canal has been cleared.

33:15.950 --> 33:19.420
[Old Master Hu, Head of
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association]

33:18.830 --> 33:20.090
His Majesty had an idea

33:20.480 --> 33:22.880
of transporting southern tea to the north,

33:23.400 --> 33:25.060
just to make everyone's lives

33:25.510 --> 33:26.840
a bit more comfortable.

33:26.880 --> 33:28.000
You overcome all obstacles,

33:28.000 --> 33:29.110
build bridges where needed,

33:29.110 --> 33:30.440
and I believe you'll bring

33:30.440 --> 33:31.310
the gold-lettered plaque
of Top Tea Under Heaven

33:31.310 --> 33:32.270
back for us at all costs!

33:32.270 --> 33:32.640
That's right!

33:32.640 --> 33:34.200
-Bring it back!
-Bring it back!

33:34.200 --> 33:35.070
Therefore,

33:35.240 --> 33:38.040
I've invited the capital's
biggest tea merchant,

33:38.350 --> 33:39.280
Li Wantang,

33:39.480 --> 33:40.270
Mr. Li,

33:40.640 --> 33:41.930
to Anhui for a meeting.

33:42.030 --> 33:43.640
It's said he has connections

33:43.640 --> 33:44.510
in both official and commercial circles.

33:44.510 --> 33:46.470
He'll surely find a way.

33:46.720 --> 33:48.400
Speaking of this Grand Tea Competition,

33:48.400 --> 33:50.690
it's organized by the greatest merchant

33:50.720 --> 33:51.520
under heaven,

33:51.750 --> 33:53.310
the capital's biggest tycoon,

33:53.310 --> 33:54.270
Li Million,

33:54.510 --> 33:56.400
Master Li Wantang.

33:56.960 --> 33:58.220
It just so happens that

33:58.510 --> 34:00.400
the Empress Dowager's birthday
is approaching,

34:00.400 --> 34:01.270
and the young Emperor

34:01.270 --> 34:02.960
wants to please his mother.

34:03.510 --> 34:04.480
That's why Master Li Wantang

34:04.480 --> 34:05.680
came up with this idea

34:05.880 --> 34:08.080
of gathering all the famous types of tea

34:08.190 --> 34:09.320
from across the land

34:09.360 --> 34:10.530
to Beijing

34:10.710 --> 34:11.670
for a competition,

34:11.670 --> 34:13.230
to rank them in order.

34:13.400 --> 34:14.340
In recent years,

34:14.630 --> 34:16.230
tea in the capital

34:16.550 --> 34:18.150
has been as precious as gold.

34:19.510 --> 34:21.820
One tael of ordinary Maojian

34:23.150 --> 34:24.610
costs two strings of cash,

34:26.440 --> 34:28.639
and one tael of fine Hou Kui

34:28.670 --> 34:29.590
or Longjing

34:30.440 --> 34:32.630
costs one tael of gold per tael.

34:34.600 --> 34:35.920
Still in short supply.

34:36.630 --> 34:37.280
And now,

34:38.070 --> 34:41.000
the finest teas from across the land
gather in the capital.

34:41.000 --> 34:42.320
competing for the top position

34:42.320 --> 34:44.050
and fighting for market share.

34:44.110 --> 34:44.840
The top-quality teas

34:44.840 --> 34:47.000
are offered to the two Empress Dowagers,

34:47.000 --> 34:48.440
with His Majesty himself
inscribing calligraphy

34:48.440 --> 34:49.480
on a grand plaque,

34:49.960 --> 34:51.320
making them famous throughout the world.

34:51.320 --> 34:52.110
Wouldn't you agree

34:52.110 --> 34:54.480
that this is truly
a once-in-a-millennium event?

34:54.480 --> 34:55.960
But there's something I don't understand.

34:55.960 --> 34:57.550
How do they rank these teas?

34:58.960 --> 35:00.420
Hou Kui has its own merits,

35:00.440 --> 35:02.150
and Silver Bud has its own charm.

35:02.150 --> 35:03.510
Some people prefer fresh tea,

35:03.510 --> 35:04.840
others prefer aged tea.

35:05.230 --> 35:06.110
Thousands of people

35:06.110 --> 35:07.710
have thousands of different tastes.

35:07.710 --> 35:10.000
So how do they determine
the top tea under heaven?

35:10.000 --> 35:10.480
Well...

35:12.800 --> 35:13.460
I've got it.

35:13.880 --> 35:15.030
Whoever holds the higher rank

35:15.030 --> 35:16.100
gets to decide.

35:16.480 --> 35:17.620
If His Majesty

35:17.670 --> 35:19.030
declares something the best in the world,

35:19.030 --> 35:20.760
you can't exactly disagree, can you?

35:20.760 --> 35:21.490
That's true.

35:21.550 --> 35:22.230
Indeed.

35:22.630 --> 35:23.880
Wholeheartedly convinced.

35:23.880 --> 35:25.400
That's great.

35:28.230 --> 35:29.360
I've got something to say!

35:29.360 --> 35:30.360
Are you crazy?

35:30.400 --> 35:32.110
I can't hold it in any longer!

35:34.440 --> 35:35.780
Excuse me, everyone.

35:36.360 --> 35:38.610
This is a distant cousin of mine

35:38.670 --> 35:40.070
from another family line
who's not very capable.

35:40.070 --> 35:41.070
His name is Hou Er.

35:41.070 --> 35:43.810
He usually helps me manage
the tea collection.

35:45.320 --> 35:46.050
My apologies

35:46.070 --> 35:47.270
if he's offended you.

35:48.480 --> 35:50.070
What do you have to say? Just say it.

35:50.070 --> 35:52.490
If there's someone who doesn't cooperate,

35:53.230 --> 35:54.030
who doesn't take

35:54.030 --> 35:55.070
our Tea Merchants' Association seriously,

35:55.070 --> 35:55.880
what should we do?

35:55.880 --> 35:58.410
What do you mean they don't
take us seriously?

35:59.880 --> 36:01.220
Hoarding goods—

36:01.670 --> 36:02.960
just refusing to sell to us.

36:02.960 --> 36:05.920
Our Tea Merchants' Association
isn't a government office.

36:05.920 --> 36:06.760
If they don't sell,

36:06.760 --> 36:09.090
of course someone else will buy from them.

36:10.510 --> 36:11.920
Did you run your mouth

36:12.190 --> 36:13.320
and offend someone?

36:14.480 --> 36:15.630
Absolutely impossible.

36:15.630 --> 36:17.290
Please have a taste of our tea.

36:26.320 --> 36:27.250
It's excellent.

36:30.360 --> 36:32.330
That guy is just an exile.

36:32.670 --> 36:34.030
He's been inciting the villagers,

36:34.030 --> 36:35.670
telling them not to sell tea
to our association.

36:35.670 --> 36:36.030
You know,

36:36.030 --> 36:38.360
it would be one thing
if he just refuses to sell.

36:38.360 --> 36:40.480
The problem is he said
all those nasty things,

36:40.480 --> 36:41.800
insulting you.

36:41.880 --> 36:43.550
I really couldn't stand it.

36:43.880 --> 36:45.340
How would he even know who I am?

36:45.340 --> 36:46.670
D-Don't talk nonsense.

36:47.000 --> 36:47.960
I'm not! You...

36:49.070 --> 36:50.080
Everyone's here.

36:50.510 --> 36:51.570
About this matter,

36:52.280 --> 36:53.760
Old Master Hu may be able to tolerate it,

36:53.760 --> 36:55.210
but I, Hou Er, cannot.

36:55.840 --> 36:56.790
From today on,

36:56.880 --> 36:57.850
if anyone buys

36:57.880 --> 36:59.840
even a single leaf of tea
from that village,

36:59.840 --> 37:01.320
it will be showing disrespect
to Old Master Hu

37:01.320 --> 37:02.540
and to me, Hou Er.

37:03.850 --> 37:04.710
I'm telling you

37:04.760 --> 37:06.110
that guy's name right now.

37:06.110 --> 37:07.940
His name is Gu Pingyuan.

37:08.360 --> 37:09.540
Gu Pingyuan.

37:10.190 --> 37:12.380
Gu Pingyuan.

37:15.800 --> 37:17.360
You're Mr. Gu Pingyuan, right?

37:17.360 --> 37:18.820
And you're Mr. Gu Pingwen.

37:18.920 --> 37:19.650
Mr. Hou Er

37:19.760 --> 37:21.470
has warned every shop

37:21.670 --> 37:23.360
that if any tea from Shanjian Village

37:23.360 --> 37:24.830
comes in, even one tael,

37:25.550 --> 37:27.190
that shop will be shut down.

37:27.510 --> 37:28.970
So as for the Huizhou area,

37:29.320 --> 37:31.180
don't expect to sell any tea here.

37:31.670 --> 37:33.110
The Tea Merchants' Association

37:33.110 --> 37:34.770
has such powerful influence.

37:35.510 --> 37:36.490
Indeed.

37:37.000 --> 37:37.980
For hundreds of years,

37:37.980 --> 37:40.380
all the tea transported north and south
by river has been under their authority.

37:40.380 --> 37:41.920
Merchants' associations
across the country

37:41.920 --> 37:43.320
communicate with each other,

37:43.320 --> 37:45.190
and in this trade,
they're the ones at the top.

37:45.190 --> 37:46.550
Whatever grievances we have,

37:46.550 --> 37:47.780
we can't speak it out.

37:48.360 --> 37:49.250
How's that?

37:49.400 --> 37:50.440
You heard all that?

37:50.440 --> 37:52.210
What's the use of me hearing it?

37:52.480 --> 37:53.480
You're the one who offended him,

37:53.480 --> 37:54.400
not me.

38:03.710 --> 38:04.310
Pingyuan.

38:05.920 --> 38:07.520
What are you thinking about?

38:08.670 --> 38:09.440
Tea.

38:09.670 --> 38:11.070
Come up with an idea then.

38:11.960 --> 38:13.160
Do you have any ideas?

38:14.000 --> 38:14.880
If you ask me,

38:15.510 --> 38:17.670
just apologize and admit you were wrong.

38:17.670 --> 38:19.630
Why insist on butting heads like this?

38:19.630 --> 38:21.230
So you also think I can't win?

38:21.590 --> 38:22.980
What makes you think you can win?

38:22.980 --> 38:24.810
We've visited so many shops—

38:25.000 --> 38:26.840
which one of them dared to buy our tea?

38:26.840 --> 38:28.800
I believe there must be a place
in this world

38:28.800 --> 38:30.130
where reason prevails.

38:31.320 --> 38:32.120
Let's do this.

38:32.400 --> 38:33.900
When we get back, sort out

38:33.960 --> 38:35.550
the best of our Orchid Snow tea.

38:35.550 --> 38:36.840
I'm going to the capital

38:36.840 --> 38:38.240
to compete against them.

38:39.110 --> 38:41.510
You're going to the Grand Tea Competition?

38:41.550 --> 38:43.190
You think you can bring back

38:43.230 --> 38:45.360
His Majesty's gold-lettered plaque?

38:45.710 --> 38:46.630
Even with a knife at your neck,

38:46.630 --> 38:48.690
you still won't miss a chance to brag.

38:52.960 --> 38:53.760
Old Master Hu.

38:54.000 --> 38:55.200
You've got a visitor.

38:57.670 --> 38:58.710
I, Gu Pingyuan,

38:58.920 --> 39:00.980
pay my respects to you, Old Master Hu.

39:01.760 --> 39:02.360
Mr. Gu,

39:03.280 --> 39:04.680
please sit down and talk.

39:11.710 --> 39:13.060
So you're the one

39:13.510 --> 39:15.150
leading the others in refusing to sell tea

39:15.150 --> 39:17.150
to our Tea Merchants' Association?

39:18.320 --> 39:19.720
I wouldn't say I led them.

39:20.150 --> 39:22.000
Mr. Hou Er haggled too ruthlessly.

39:22.000 --> 39:23.210
I was upset at the time

39:23.360 --> 39:24.920
and ended up speaking rather harshly.

39:24.920 --> 39:25.710
Old Master Hu, I know you are

39:25.710 --> 39:27.760
the head of
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association,

39:27.760 --> 39:30.020
so I've come specifically to apologize.

39:32.280 --> 39:33.320
This Hou Er

39:34.150 --> 39:35.320
is indeed a distant relative of mine

39:35.320 --> 39:36.780
from another family line.

39:38.000 --> 39:38.670
However,

39:39.190 --> 39:40.050
since everyone

39:41.000 --> 39:42.380
recognizes me as

39:42.480 --> 39:44.940
the head of
the Tea Merchants' Association,

39:44.960 --> 39:45.630
they all say

39:46.360 --> 39:48.070
I'm quite fair in my dealings.

39:48.670 --> 39:52.090
If Hou Er was in any way

39:52.590 --> 39:54.180
remiss in his words,

39:55.000 --> 39:57.150
please forgive him, Mr. Gu.

39:58.590 --> 39:59.990
Please trouble yourself

40:00.320 --> 40:02.690
to tell the villagers

40:03.360 --> 40:05.570
to deliver the tea leaves

40:05.710 --> 40:08.240
directly to
the Tea Merchants' Association.

40:09.590 --> 40:10.390
Old Master Hu.

40:11.070 --> 40:12.840
This is the new tea our family has grown.

40:12.840 --> 40:13.670
I've specially brought it over

40:13.670 --> 40:14.600
for you to taste.

40:28.710 --> 40:30.610
[Orchid Snow]

40:34.840 --> 40:36.710
Isn't this Silver Bud?

40:38.070 --> 40:40.670
What do these words

40:41.090 --> 40:42.220
"Orchid Snow" mean?

40:42.550 --> 40:44.110
This tea is blessed by heaven and earth.

40:44.110 --> 40:44.920
After it's grown,

40:44.920 --> 40:46.280
it has a unique aroma—

40:46.760 --> 40:48.490
a subtle fragrance of orchids,

40:49.000 --> 40:51.160
yet also like green pines after snow:

40:51.490 --> 40:52.800
crisp, pure, and noble.

40:52.800 --> 40:54.130
That's why we renamed it

40:54.280 --> 40:55.210
"Orchid Snow."

40:59.960 --> 41:01.550
The name of the tea

41:02.570 --> 41:04.230
was decided by our ancestors.

41:05.630 --> 41:07.890
By changing its name randomly like this,

41:08.280 --> 41:09.280
aren't you breaking

41:09.280 --> 41:10.540
the ancestors' rules?

41:11.150 --> 41:13.010
No wonder Hou Er wouldn't take it.

41:13.440 --> 41:15.040
Change it back to Silver Bud,

41:15.110 --> 41:16.370
and then I'll taste it.

41:16.760 --> 41:17.630
Old Master Hu.

41:18.190 --> 41:19.030
This tea's fragrance

41:19.030 --> 41:21.190
is truly different from
ordinary Silver Bud.

41:21.190 --> 41:22.520
It's a brand new flavor.

41:23.070 --> 41:24.360
Why don't you give it a try?

41:24.360 --> 41:25.840
New or old, what nonsense.

41:27.030 --> 41:28.070
I've been in the tea business

41:28.070 --> 41:29.410
my entire life.

41:29.960 --> 41:31.840
How could I allow
such disrespect for tradition?

41:31.840 --> 41:33.840
If I let you get away with this today,

41:34.320 --> 41:35.970
what if everyone

41:36.280 --> 41:38.080
starts renaming them randomly?

41:38.110 --> 41:40.000
Should I discipline them or not?

41:43.190 --> 41:44.050
Change it back.

41:53.050 --> 41:54.180
I'm sorry. No can do.

42:03.400 --> 42:04.460
What are you doing?

42:04.520 --> 42:05.650
I can walk by myself.

42:05.880 --> 42:06.590
Let's go. Hurry.

42:06.590 --> 42:07.370
Let go.

42:08.510 --> 42:09.770
They're finally back.

42:13.440 --> 42:14.030
Come on.

42:14.630 --> 42:15.030
Sit.

42:20.710 --> 42:21.710
Everyone's here.

42:22.400 --> 42:23.660
Tell us what happened.

42:23.760 --> 42:25.030
I don't quite understand yet.

42:25.030 --> 42:25.890
What happened?

42:26.150 --> 42:27.270
The Tea Merchants' Association

42:27.270 --> 42:28.000
has officially announced

42:28.000 --> 42:30.150
they won't buy our village's tea anymore.

42:30.150 --> 42:31.610
Was it Hou Er who said that?

42:31.920 --> 42:32.800
Not just Hou Er.

42:33.190 --> 42:35.450
If it were just Hou Er,
that would be fine.

42:35.590 --> 42:36.710
But if the Tea Merchants' Association

42:36.710 --> 42:37.970
refuses to buy our tea,

42:38.440 --> 42:39.190
then it would be

42:39.190 --> 42:41.120
a disaster for our entire village.

42:41.190 --> 42:42.360
Indeed.

42:47.960 --> 42:48.430
Come on.

42:48.630 --> 42:49.960
Bring the stuff up here.

42:56.590 --> 42:57.840
Tomorrow, you two brothers

42:57.840 --> 42:58.900
carry these briers

42:59.150 --> 43:00.670
and come with me to
the Tea Merchants' Association.
